<title>CHINA: Herald Holdings year net rises 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Herald Holdings year net rises 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.25	vs 1.92</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.50	vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  8.10 loss vs 11.39 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    13.63     vs 11.79</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,025.80  vs 1,246.50</p>
<p>    Company name		 Herald Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 4-5</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Sept 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Herald Holdings is a holding company with interests in toy manufacturing, aluminium, houseware and computer magnetic heads.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 2.50 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
